  "body": "Port of https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=25797\r\n\r\nThis is referring to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-list-of-available-images. Note that the key is the request URL, not the response URL.\r\n\r\nAs noted there,\r\n\r\n> Probably worth testing browsers to see what they do. If they include the fragid in the key, then I bet there's some page out there using this to trigger reloads for changed images or something.",
